    "description": {
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> Farum is charged and you can cast a runic cantrip or spell.</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You invoke Nefelus to overcharge your runic spell through the accumulated magic in Farum. You cast a runic cantrip or spell with its number of actions. As the magic is unleashed and the spell hits, you deal an additional @Damage[1d4[force]] damage to creatures affected by your spell. At 10th level, the additional damage increases to @Damage[2d4[force]] force damage. At 18th level, it increases to @Damage[3d4[force]] force damage. Farum is no longer charged.</p>",
      "gm": ""
    },
